{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20018960,"chapterID":15000602,"chapterNumber":"VI-2","sectionNumber":"62-345","title":"Developments on floating structures","officialText":"","previewText":"In all districts, the underlying height and setback regulations shall be inapplicable to developments on floating structures, except for WD uses in C8 and Manufacturing Districts. In lieu thereof, the provisions of this Section shall apply.\n\nBase plane shall be inapplicable for floating structures. Height shall be measured from the water line of the floating structure to the highest point of the roof or uppermost ope","blocks":[{"id":"zr-18960-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In all districts, the underlying height and setback regulations shall be inapplicable to <strong><em>developments</em></strong> on <strong><em>floating structures</em></strong>, except for WD <strong><em>uses</em></strong> in C8 and <strong><em>Manufacturing Districts</em></strong>. In lieu thereof, the provisions of this Section shall apply.</span></p>","plainText":"In all districts, the underlying height and setback regulations shall be inapplicable to developments on floating structures, except for WD uses in C8 and Manufacturing Districts. In lieu thereof, the provisions of this Section shall apply."},{"id":"zr-18960-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p><span><strong><em>Base plane</em></strong> shall be inapplicable for <strong><em>floating structures</em></strong>. Height shall be measured from the water line of the <strong><em>floating structure</em></strong> to the highest point of the roof or uppermost open deck. However, the following obstructions are permitted to penetrate a height limit:</span></p>","plainText":"Base plane shall be inapplicable for floating structures. Height shall be measured from the water line of the floating structure to the highest point of the roof or uppermost open deck. However, the following obstructions are permitted to penetrate a height limit:"},{"id":"zr-18960-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>Chimneys, flues or stacks;</span></p>","plainText":"Chimneys, flues or stacks;"},{"id":"zr-18960-block-004","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>Flagpoles, aerials or masts;</span></p>","plainText":"Flagpoles, aerials or masts;"},{"id":"zr-18960-block-005","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>Parapet walls or safety enclosures, not more than four feet high; and</span></p>","plainText":"Parapet walls or safety enclosures, not more than four feet high; and"},{"id":"zr-18960-block-006","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>Wire, chain link or other transparent fences.</span></p>","plainText":"Wire, chain link or other transparent fences."},{"id":"zr-18960-block-007","kind":"html","html":"<p><span><strong><em>Developments</em></strong> permitted as-of-right pursuant to Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-vi/chapter-2#62-25\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-vi/chapter-2#62-25\"><span>62-25</span></a> shall not exceed a height of 23 feet. <strong><em>Developments</em></strong> on <strong><em>floating structures</em></strong> pursuant to the special permit provisions of Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-vi/chapter-2#62-834\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-vi/chapter-2#62-834\"><span>62-834</span></a> shall not exceed the height limits set forth in Column A of the table in this Section, except for navigational vessels being repurposed as <strong><em>floating structures</em></strong> in accordance with such special permit provisions. Such repurposed vessels shall be subject to the height limits set forth in Column B of the table.</span></p>","plainText":"Developments permitted as-of-right pursuant to Section 62-25 shall not exceed a height of 23 feet. Developments on floating structures pursuant to the special permit provisions of Section 62-834 shall not exceed the height limits set forth in Column A of the table in this Section, except for navigational vessels being repurposed as floating structures in accordance with such special permit provisions. Such repurposed vessels shall be subject to the height limits set forth in Column B of the table."},{"id":"zr-18960-block-008","kind":"html","html":"<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:center 3.25in left 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in 5.0in 5.5in 6.0in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">HEIGHT LIMITS FOR FLOATING STRUCTURES</span></span></span></p>","plainText":"HEIGHT LIMITS FOR FLOATING STRUCTURES"},{"id":"zr-18960-block-009","kind":"table","html":"<table align=\"center\" class=\"Table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:114px; padding:0in 8px 0in 8px\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:114px; padding:0in 8px 0in 8px\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:120px; padding:0in 8px 0in 8px\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:90px; padding:0in 8px 0in 8px; border-top:none; border-right:none; border-left:none\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in 5.0in 5.5in 6.0in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Column A</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:96px; padding:0in 8px 0in 8px; border-top:none; border-right:none; border-left:none\" valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:0in .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.